#. module: nudge_mcp
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/nudge_mcp/models/nudge_mcp.py:0
msgid ""
"Nothing has been changed yet. This is what would change:\n"
"%(lines)s\n"
"\n"
"Show it to the person. If they agree, call confirm with the token %(token)s ; if they do not, call decline with it. The token is good for %(minutes)s minutes."
msgstr ""
"لم يتغير شيء بعد. هذا ما سيتغير:\n"
"%(lines)s\n"
"\n"
"أره للشخص. إن وافق، استدعِ confirm بالرمز %(token)s ؛ وإن لم يوافق، استدعِ decline به. الرمز صالح لمدة %(minutes)s دقيقة."

#. module: nudge_mcp
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/nudge_mcp/models/nudge_mcp.py:0
msgid ""
"Nothing is changed by this call: it returns a token and what will change. "
"Show it to the person, then call confirm with the token."
msgstr ""
"لا يتغير شيء بهذا الاستدعاء: يرجع رمزاً وما سيتغير. أره للشخص ثم استدعِ "
"confirm بالرمز."

